    m_Localized: Wave {0} Cleared
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7338888477077143554
  - m_Id: 44124330363761155
    m_Localized: A decisive defense. Review what changed before the next assault.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761156
    m_Localized: The realm holds. Review the result, then prepare the next defense.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761157
    m_Localized: Prepare for Wave {0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7338888477077143554
  - m_Id: 44124330363761158
    m_Localized: Plans Recovered
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761159
    m_Localized: The realm holds - but it took damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761160
    m_Localized: The realm holds. Spoils claimed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761161
    m_Localized: Showing {0} of {1} damaged structures.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7338888477077143554
  - m_Id: 44124330363761162
    m_Localized: Retreat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761163
    m_Localized: Time!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761164
    m_Localized: Return to Castle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761165
    m_Localized: The clock ran out - your warband falls back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761166
    m_Localized: You called the assault off.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761167
    m_Localized: '{0}% razed.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7338888477077143554
  - m_Id: 44124330363761168
    m_Localized: Every troop came home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761169
    m_Localized: 1 troop lost
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761170
    m_Localized: '{0} troops lost'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7338888477077143554
  - m_Id: 44124330363761171
    m_Localized: '- the assault failed and the warband did not make it back.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761172
    m_Localized: '- the cost of covering the retreat.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761173
    m_Localized: No spoils - the warband was lost.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761174
    m_Localized: Some of the reward could not be paid out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761175
    m_Localized: Three waves came against Elarion. Three waves broke.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761176
    m_Localized: You recovered the Castle Defense Plans. They unlock the Arcane Spire,
      and include enough resources to build your first one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761177
    m_Localized: '"Open Build, choose Defenses, and place the Arcane Spire now. It
      will protect Elarion from the stronger waves ahead."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761178
    m_Localized: ARMEE WECHSELN
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
